+- `.spec/decisions.md`
+- `.spec/packet-plane.md`
+- `README.md`
+- `LOGBOOK.md`
+
+ADR SHA-256:
+`f2dc587541386cdc5eb7e10328adda21b8bbba3af32d5c722e62616a2abca173`.
